WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.003
Hi, my name is Eric
and I am a current senior

2
00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.006
studying Business Administration
at Carnegie Mellon University.

3
00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.476
One of my favorite things
in the Cohon University Center

4
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.645
is the Scotland Yard game room
that is located on the lower level.

5
00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.782
There are games such as pool, foosball,

6
00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:19.152
ping pong and shuffleboard
available for students to play.

7
00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:23.023
Oftentimes, my friends would come here
in between classes or on a Friday

8
00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:23.857
or Saturday night

9
00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:27.260
to spend a couple of hours playing pool
or foosball against each other

10
00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.862
and get really competitive.

11
00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.497
It can get really busy here sometimes.

12
00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:33.199
So if you're thinking about coming down
to play a couple of games,

13
00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.102
you better snag a table really quick,
otherwise you might miss out.

